# cortex — copy to .env.local and fill in. No real values belong in this file.

# --- required ---------------------------------------------------------------
BRAIN_REPO=ShootJackal/brain
GITHUB_TOKEN=
# Bearer for /api/mcp. Trimmed before comparison; empty or whitespace-only is
# refused at request time. Short tokens are warned about in the log but accepted —
# refusing a deployment's own configured secret locks the operator out.
MCP_TOKEN=
# Required by brain_ask, which calls a reader model on every invocation. Without
# it brain_ask throws; the other tools are unaffected. (Needed for the default
# claude-* readers; see the pluggable-reader block below for the others.)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- required for the claude.ai custom connector ----------------------------
# Header-less clients use /api/s/<CONNECTOR_PATH_SECRET>/mcp instead of a bearer.
CONNECTOR_PATH_SECRET=

# --- optional: pluggable reader ---------------------------------------------
# The reader model is pluggable — see lib/reader.ts for the allowlist. Fill only
# the keys for providers you actually use; Claude stays the measured default.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Deployment-default reader model (callers can still pick per call). Blank = the
# measured default, claude-sonnet-5. An invalid value fails loudly on first ask.
# READER_MODEL=

# --- optional: the guest door -----------------------------------------------
# A SECOND, DIFFERENT secret. /api/g/<GUEST_PATH_SECRET>/mcp serves a reduced
# toolset — read the brain, propose a note, nothing else. Hand this one to an
# assistant you do not control. It must not equal CONNECTOR_PATH_SECRET; the
# route refuses to serve if they match, because a shared secret would mean
# revoking the guest also revokes you. Blank = no guest door exists.
GUEST_PATH_SECRET=

# --- optional ---------------------------------------------------------------
# BRAIN_BRANCH=main
# BRAIN_TZ=America/Los_Angeles
